        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "End of terrace four bedroom house.\r\nExtending to approximately 119 sq. m (1,280 sq. ft).\r\nOff street parking to the front.\r\nGarden to the rear.\r\nOil fired central heating.\r\nConvenient to a host of amenities.\r\nVacant possession.\r\n\r\nThis property provides a well laid out and spacious four bedroom end of terrace house. The property is situated in Harbour Village development located approximately 1.5km west of Westport town centre.The accommodation comprises an entrance hall, living room with feature fireplace, open plan kitchen/dining area, lounge & WC. The stairs leads to the first floor which consists of landing area, four bedrooms (master en-suite), family bathroom & storage/hot press. The property benefits from off street parking to the front and enclosed rear garden. The property is within close proximity to a host of amenities including shops, schools, bars, restaurants, hotels & numerous sports clubs.\r\n\r\nVacant possession."
